nnot separate real defensive adjustment from offense executing differently; near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 523 cells; 440 pairs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-011", "score": 0.113, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPM-011 | Study family SF-APPM-011: Net-swing play-type scoring prototype\n- observed_research_question: Net-swing play-type scoring prototype\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Scoring PTs by own PPP minus opponent next-possession PPP changes recommendations.\n- observed_result: Top recommendation changes in 40/104 = 38% units; DRIVE median net swing -0.27 (negative 88%), POST_UP -0.22 (77%).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Not evaluated against outcomes; uses in-series observed opp_next_PPP.\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-049\n- observed_method: 52 playoff series / 104 team-offense units; compare rank orderings own-PPP vs net-swing.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-006"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-034", "score": 0.094, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-034 | Study family SF-APPA-034: Opponent-relative leverage prevalence sweep\n- observed_research_question: Opponent-relative leverage prevalence sweep\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: How often does an opponent-specific exploitable defensive weakness exist?\n- observed_result: Exploit available 33.3%; trap 23.3%; both 6.7%; neither 50.0%; median best edge 3.79%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_sample_and_power: 870 pairs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: 870 ordered team pairs; defense PT edge vs league >= +5% on seed PTs.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: Edges depend only on the defense (e.g. DAL PNR +9.2% for every offense), so they are not matchup-specific.\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-068\n- auto_uses_dataset: DS:NCAA_tournament_and_ratings_data"}], "n_results": 4}

